    "outcome": "SUCCEEDED",
    "result": {
      "schemaVersion": "knowledge-qa-result-v1",
      "answerability": "ANSWERED",
      "answer": "不能。身份归属固定为 issuer+audience+organization，tenant 映射为 local-agentic，userId 为 IdP 稳定 sub；浏览器、展示名、用户名、owner 请求头或角色文字都不决定归属[1]。业务 scope 仅来自服务端已登记的个人成员策略，复用 knowledge/conversation/task 的 read/write，不授予管理或其他用户资料的访问权[1]。",
